      "text": "I’d choose the January 15 Aeroplan award via Hong Kong if reaching Bangkok sooner matters most: it arrives at 10:25 p.m. on January 16. The tradeoff is a daytime departure from San Francisco and an economy award whose reported cabin does not establish the cabin of each flight leg.",
